# meta-marbles-22-completion.prompt

> **Self-contained.** This artifact carries every fact you need to operate
> against it. You do NOT need to read the 22 original LSP plan files. Each
> task below embeds: current broken state, target state, file:line refs,
> test contract, negative check, and round-trip e2e shape. If you find
> yourself wanting to "go read Plan NN" — STOP. Re-read this prompt; the
> answer is here. If it's not, the prompt has a gap and you should fix the
> prompt before the task.
>
> 𝚅𝚒𝚋𝚎𝚌𝚛𝚊𝚏𝚝𝚎𝚍. with AI Agents by Vetcoders (c)2024-2026 LibraxisAI

