### Tier 5 — SaaS-transformation wave entry (Plans 23 + 24)

> **Context:** Loctree the LSP daemon serves AI agents (JSON over stdio).
> Loctree the SaaS serves human teams via `loctree.com/cloud/teams/{slug}/`.
> The HTML report layer is the visible-to-humans surface. Currently
> `loctree-rs/src/analyzer/html.rs` produces a minimal `report.html` but
> the rendering is not wired into a deployable artifact flow and uses
> ad-hoc styling unrelated to the loctree.com design system. Tier 5 closes
> both gaps.
>
> These tasks are intentionally larger than Tier 1-4 (estimated 8-16h each).
> Pick one and complete; do not interleave 23 and 24.

#### Task 23 · M-L · Wire HTML layer into real analyzer flow

- [ ] **Status:** open

**What's broken:** No `loct report` subcommand. HTML drops out of `loct context` / `loct auto` opportunistically; agents don't request it, humans don't know it exists. The report doesn't surface Plan 14 semantic facts (idiom tags, dispatch edges, env contracts, Tauri commands/events, framework hints) or Plan 19 cross-language coverage. No manifest sidecar for SaaS ingestion.

**Target state:** `loct report [--scope <S>] [--project <P>] [--out-dir <D>] [--with-aicx] [--saas-base <URL>]` materializes:

```
<root>/.loctree/reports/<snapshot-fingerprint>/
  ├── index.html              # SSR Leptos report (entry)
  ├── report.manifest.json    # protocol: "loctree.report.manifest.v1"
  ├── assets/                 # bundled Cytoscape JS, dagre, cose-base, layout-base
  └── data/snapshot.json      # raw snapshot for SaaS ingestion
```

**Report sections (in order):**
1. Header (project name + fingerprint + generated_at + scope/task marker).
2. Atlas Panel (atlas pointer cards from Plan 01; link out to `<saas_base_url>/cloud/reports/<fingerprint>/cards/<card_id>` when `--saas-base` set).
3. Risk Register (cycles, dead exports, twins, hotspots — Plan 09 health surface).
4. Semantic Facts (idiom tags, dispatch edges, env contracts, tauri commands/events, framework hints; each with `AuthorityLabel` badge).
5. Structural Graph (Cytoscape — files as nodes, imports as edges).
6. Cross-Language Coverage (TS/JS/TSX extractor coverage banner; other languages show "OXC fallback" annotation).
7. Footer (loctree version + scope description + AICX presence flag).

**Manifest shape (`loctree.report.manifest.v1`):**
- `fingerprint`, `project_root`, `scan_id`, `generated_at` (ISO-8601), `artifact_version`
- `facts_count: { idiom_tags, dispatch_edges, reachability, env_contracts, tauri_commands, tauri_events, framework_hints }`
- `scope: Option<ScopeReport>`, `task: Option<TaskReport>` (Plan 22 metadata)
- `aicx_included: bool`

**Files to create / touch:**
- `loctree-rs/src/cli/parser/report_commands.rs` (NEW) — parser.
- `loctree-rs/src/cli/dispatch/handlers/report.rs` (NEW) — orchestration.
- `loctree-rs/src/cli/dispatch/handlers/report/manifest.rs` (NEW) — manifest write.
- `loctree-rs/src/cli/dispatch/handlers/report/assets.rs` (NEW) — JS bundling.
- `loctree-rs/src/types.rs` — `ReportArtifact`, `ReportManifest`, `ReportFactsCount` types (with `schemars::JsonSchema` derives).
- `loctree-rs/src/analyzer/html.rs` — extend `render_html` to consume `ReportArtifact`; add Section 4 (Semantic Facts) + Section 6 (Cross-Lang Coverage).
- `reports/src/components/semantic_facts.rs` (NEW) — Leptos component with authority badges.
- `reports/src/components/cross_language_coverage.rs` (NEW).
- `reports/src/components/manifest_footer.rs` (NEW).
- `loctree-rs/tests/report_artifact.rs` (NEW) — integration test.
- `loctree-rs/src/cli/command/help_texts.rs` — `loct report` help.

**Test contract:**
- Build a fixture repo with 5 files, 1 cycle, 2 dead exports, 1 idiom-tag.
- Run `loct report --out-dir <tmp>` against the fixture.
- Assert all 8 wire-contract paths exist.
- Deserialize `report.manifest.json` to `ReportManifest`; assert `facts_count.idiom_tags == 1`, `protocol == "loctree.report.manifest.v1"`.
- Load `index.html` as bytes; assert it contains the project name, the idiom tag string, and the cycle file paths.

**Cross-repo coordination:** This plan enables but does NOT implement `loctree-com/src/server/reports.rs` (POST `/api/v1/reports/upload` multipart route) — that's a separate cut on the `loctree-com` repo (likely `loctree-com/docs/licensing/polar-sh/12-reports-ingestion.md`).

**Non-goals:**
- No styling discipline (Task 24).
- No SaaS-side upload endpoint.
- No interactive diff between two snapshots (queued as Plan 25+).
- No JS-driven re-querying inside the artifact.
- No new analyzer behavior.

**Complexity:** M-L (estimated 8-12h).

**Dependencies:** Plan 14 (semantic facts) + Plan 19 (cross-lang) already landed.

