## 9. Exit contract — when all P1 + P2 are `[x]`

1. **Re-run reconciliation audit.** Dispatch 6 parallel Opus subagents (or `prview` if scope-bounded) against the post-fixes state. Confirm:
   - Plan 04 verdict moves PARTIAL → PASS (after 04a + 04b land).
   - Plan 11, 18, 12 consumers, 10 watcher verdicts move PASS_WITH_GAPS → PASS.
   - No new findings beyond P3 cosmetic.
2. **Dispatch `/vc-polarize` with the §7 prism framings.** Read the smear score:
   - If smear ≤ 0.3 (low), skip polarize — operator already has primary axis defined.
   - If smear > 0.3, polarize emits primary axis decision + DoU handoff.
3. **Bump TRACKER `last_updated`** + flip rows 23/24 from `queued` to `in-progress` (or `done` if Tier 5 completed in the same wave).
4. **Move this prompt to archive.** `mv docs/plans/lsp/meta-marbles-22-completion.prompt docs/plans/lsp/archive/2026_MMDD/meta-marbles-22-completion.prompt`.
5. **Open the next prompt.** `docs/plans/lsp/meta-marbles-saas-handoff.prompt` seeded with:
   - The polarize verdict (primary axis).
   - Tier 5 deliverables (if not done in this wave).
   - SaaS-side coordination tasks (`loctree-com/docs/licensing/polar-sh/12-reports-ingestion.md` queued there).

