| Scenario | Decision |
|---|---|
| All P1 done, mixed P2, no P3 | Operator decides: ship to dogfooders with PASS_WITH_GAPS framing, or close P2 first. |
| P1 partially done | Do NOT ship public release. Reconcile-audit will still flag 04 as PARTIAL. |
| Tier 5 done but Tier 1-4 not | SaaS artifact ready but LSP roadmap not closed. Operator decides whether SaaS demo can use a "preview / known issues" framing. |
| Polarize emits competing-truth verdict | Operator + agents discuss; this prompt does not encode product strategy. |

